  "v1Copy0388": "What can leave this phone",
  "v1Copy0389": "Writing out a recording, or reading it against what you said before, ",
  "v1Copy0390": "only happens off this phone if you turn on remote processing. Sync is ",
  "v1Copy0391": "a different choice: if you sign in and back up, an encrypted copy can ",
  "v1Copy0392": "leave this phone, and the server cannot read it. While remote ",
  "v1Copy0393": "processing is off, those new words are not sent for a transcript or a ",
  "v1Copy0397": "What stays on your device",
  "v1Copy0398": "Your archive entries, recorded details, action items, surfacing choices, ",
  "v1Copy0399": "memory controls, packs, pins, and collections are stored locally by default. ",
  "v1Copy0400": "Archive metadata and prefs stay on this device as well.",
  "v1Copy0401": "Cloud transcription and analysis",
  "v1Copy0402": "When remote processing is on, Thoughtprint sends recorded audio for ",
  "v1Copy0403": "transcription and transcript text for reflection. When it is off, ",
  "v1Copy0404": "new entries are recorded on this device only. Anything already recorded ",
  "v1Copy0405": "stays exactly as it is.",
  "v1Copy0406": "Optional encrypted backup",
  "v1Copy0407": "If you sign in and enable sync, backup data is encrypted before it is ",
  "v1Copy0408": "uploaded, using a key held on this device. The server stores that ",
  "v1Copy0409": "backup as ciphertext. Sync is optional.",
  "v1Copy0410": "What Thoughtprint does not do",
  "v1Copy0411": "Thoughtprint does not sell your reflections. Thoughtprint does not include ",
  "v1Copy0412": "recording text in analytics. Thoughtprint does not turn every entry into ",
  "v1Copy0413": "personal memory by default. Thoughtprint is not therapy, medical advice, ",
  "v1Copy0414": "or emergency support.",
