  "v1Copy0416": "You can mark entries as Hypothetical, Not about me, Sensitive, ",
  "v1Copy0417": "Do not surface, Preserve original, Keep separate, or Treat as new.",
  "v1Copy0418": "Processing providers",
  "v1Copy0419": "Remote processing is off until you turn it on, and these companies ",
  "v1Copy0420": "receive nothing before then. If you turn it on: OpenAI receives a ",
  "v1Copy0421": "along with structured details of the earlier entries it is compared ",
  "v1Copy0422": "against — to draft a reflection. Google receives streamed audio during ",
  "v1Copy0423": "a live conversation, where that feature is available. Encrypted backup ",
  "v1Copy0424": "is separate: sync uploads ciphertext, so the server holds backup data ",
  "v1Copy0425": "it cannot read.",
